Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/lambda_escape_no_take.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     val item = NoClone { tag: 1 };
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/lambda_escape_no_take.jet:11:5
    |
 11 |     val f = (n: Int) => {
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0003]: expected a statement, found a number
  --> tests/ui/lambda_escape_no_take.jet:13:9
